{"sha":"63a3aa3e533ba466f02f1deabd36b9d3feb88985","node_id":"C_kwDOQ07FcNoAKDYzYTNhYTNlNTMzYmE0NjZmMDJmMWRlYWJkMzZiOWQzZmViODg5ODU","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/schiste/Aethyme/git/commits/63a3aa3e533ba466f02f1deabd36b9d3feb88985","html_url":"https://github.com/schiste/Aethyme/commit/63a3aa3e533ba466f02f1deabd36b9d3feb88985","author":{"name":"Christophe Henner","email":"christophehenner@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-16T00:34:27Z"},"committer":{"name":"Christophe Henner","email":"christophehenner@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-16T00:34:27Z"},"tree":{"sha":"e593dc9bfe6ac2113d3fb23d21744fa670199774","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/schiste/Aethyme/git/trees/e593dc9bfe6ac2113d3fb23d21744fa670199774"},"message":"feat(contracts): add experimental local identity revisions\n\nProblem\nLocal project mappings and contribution rationale changes need immutable, bounded records without granting workflow authority.\n\nDecision\nAdd experimental project descriptors, stable FileIds with explicit lineage operations, and content-addressed contribution revisions that bind exact source snapshots and optional brief objects.\n\nRationale\nThe contracts keep local ProjectKey storage separate from logical project identity, preserve uncertainty for inferred renames, and make brief-only changes produce a new revision.\n\nValidation\nRan rustfmt and git diff --check. Cargo and native tests were not run under the active runtime gate.","parents":[{"sha":"025103777c16607639073cbf9024d2ad0c39f72d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/schiste/Aethyme/git/commits/025103777c16607639073cbf9024d2ad0c39f72d","html_url":"https://github.com/schiste/Aethyme/commit/025103777c16607639073cbf9024d2ad0c39f72d"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}}